1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:04,960
Jejak letusan ala Pompeii ternyata
ditemukan 6 kilometer di bawah laut,

2
00:00:04,960 --> 00:00:06,580
di Palung Mariana...

3
00:00:06,580 --> 00:00:09,240
padahal harusnya mustahil!

4
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:11,770
Tekanan airnya 600 kali lipat.

5
00:00:11,770 --> 00:00:14,280
Gas di magma tak bisa mengembang...

6
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:15,940
jadi tak mungkin meledak.

7
00:00:15,940 --> 00:00:19,510
Tapi robot penyelam menemukan
bekas aliran panasnya...

8
00:00:19,510 --> 00:00:22,230
2 kilometer lebih dalam dari rekor lama!

9
00:00:22,230 --> 00:00:24,340
Dan sumber letusannya...

10
00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:26,380
sampai sekarang belum ketemu.

11
00:00:26,380 --> 00:00:26,980
Follow,

12
00:00:26,980 --> 00:00:29,320
besok ada yang lebih aneh.
